- op: discuss  # a475
  at: '2026-11-13T22:17:42Z'  # a475
  by: agent  # a475
  actor: jgstern_agent  # a475
  clock: 3  # a475
  nonce: a475  # a475
  message: "Done in PR #2176 (commits aa92572804 and aa5631fe0f).\nRULE (any language's models and symbols): a list cut by rank and then grouped by file says, under each file shown, how many of that file's entries are not shown; the section's last line counts only the entries of files not shown at all, and how many files those are. Bullets plus the file's line are the file's entries. A file's group is NOT kept whole when most of it made the cut: rank decides what is shown (stated in ADR-0005 and the spec).\nTHE SAME DEFECT WAS IN KEY SYMBOLS, found while confirming the item's \"check every section\": a shown file's unselected symbols were counted as symbols \"across N other files\". kserve at 8k said \"(... and 5659 more symbols across 534 other files)\" with 459 of the 5659 in the 20 files shown. Entry Points was checked and counts within each group.\nRENDERED, kserve (Python and Go) at 8k: Data Models' \"... and 182 more data models\" became five \"... and N more in this file\" lines (144 models) and \"... and 38 more data models in 25 other files\"; Key Symbols has 20 per-file lines and \"(... and 5200 more symbols across 534 other files)\". killbill (Java): a per-file line under every Key Symbols heading. Fixture tests: a Python file and two interleaved Go files whose models straddle the cut, Rust models in files not shown, a model with no path. Seven mutations each turned a test red.\nA REGRESSION THIS CHANGE CAUSED, AND ITS FIX. The per-file lines made each Key Symbols block larger. Key Symbols was sized by a count (its share over 35 tokens a symbol), so on killbill at 32k without source it passed what was left of the budget, and the last step of generation dropped Key Symbols and Additional Files whole (31,980 tokens before, 16,984 after). I found it by comparing the section list of 30 sketches before and after, not by a test. Commit aa5631fe0f cuts Key Symbols by what it costs. Final renderings (30 sketches, five repositories, 8k/32k/128k, with and without source; base/before vs base/after-final2): no sketch lost a section, eight gained one; killbill 32k without source is 31,981 of 32,000 tokens with Key Symbols 12,104 and Additional Files 2,907 tokens.\nCOST: the Key Symbols section spends part of its share on the per-file lines (kserve 8k: 20 lines, about 170 tokens)."  # a475
